# Whitelist: only the pipeline "core" is versioned.
# content/ (source PDFs, scripts, generated images, audio) and research/ stay local.
*
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!CLAUDE.md
!WORKFLOW.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!.mcp.json
!.gitmodules
!.claude/
!.claude/**
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.claude/settings.local.json
**/__pycache__/
!tools/
!tools/**

__pycache__/
*.pyc
